    <description>Created into a new flow because of previous one reached maximum number of versions.

Initiated from a Lightning Quick Action from the Opportunity object, create a new Quote and navigate to the Line Editor. BOPI-444 Updated to require the Account Billing and Shipping country before creating the quote. BOPI-444 Updated to remove the hardcoded Quote RecordType and Pricebook2 Ids

Removed the hard coded Id value for Strategic Partner.

BOPI-562 Updated 11/20/2024 to prevent users from creating new quotes on Renewal and Amendment quotes

BOPI-604 Old primary quote must be deleted when Ship to Account is out of sync</description>
